      "HiddenChannelCapacity.acyclic_iff_forall_consistent_glues"
    ],
    "pretty": "∀ {ι : Type u_1} [inst : DecidableEq ι] [inst_1 : Fintype ι] (𝒞 : Finset (Finset ι)),\n  HiddenChannelCapacity.Acyclic 𝒞 ↔\n    ∀ (fam : List (HiddenChannelCapacity.LocalStruct ι fun x => ZMod 2)),\n      List.map (fun x => x.team) fam = 𝒞.toList →\n        HiddenChannelCapacity.Consistent fam → (∀ L ∈ fam, L.rel.Nonempty) → HiddenChannelCapacity.Glues fam",
    "type_sha256": "64ea316dd7aa35d93a60efb759e11b21a75a8f9a834c3ac8f950ffb16827a15e"
